  "exported_at": "2026-03-10T00:00:00.000Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "nb-lua-demo-001",
    "name": "Lua: テーブル、コルーチン、クロージャ",
    "description": "A tour of Lua's most distinctive features — tables as the universal data structure, coroutines for cooperative multitasking, closures for encapsulation, and custom iterators.",
    "kernelLanguage": "lua",
    "cellCounter": 24,
    "cells": [
      {
        "code": "# Lua: テーブル、コルーチン、クロージャ\n\nLua は、いくつかの強力なアイデアを中心に構築された軽量スクリプト言語です。このワークブックでは、Lua を独自たらしめている特徴を探求します:\n\n- **テーブル** — 唯一のデータ構造でありながら、あらゆる用途に対応\n- **コルーチン** — 言語に組み込まれた協調的マルチタスク\n- **クロージャ** — 自身を囲む環境をキャプチャする関数\n- **イテレータ** — コルーチンとクロージャによるカスタム反復処理\n\nSciREPL は、純粋な JavaScript による Lua 5.3 仮想マシンである [Fengari](https://fengari.io) を介して Lua を実行します。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "## 1. テーブルがすべて\n\nLua には複合データ構造が1つしかありません。それが**テーブル**です。テーブルは配列、辞書、オブジェクト、モジュール、名前空間の役割を — 同時にすべて果たします。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Arrays (1-indexed!)\nfruits = {\"apple\", \"banana\", \"cherry\"}\nprint(fruits[1], fruits[2], fruits[3])\nprint(\"length:\", #fruits)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Dictionaries\nplanet = {\n  name = \"Earth\",\n  radius_km = 6371,\n  has_life = true\n}\nprint(planet.name, \"—\", planet.radius_km, \"km radius\")\n\n-- Add fields dynamically\nplanet.moons = 1\nprint(\"Moons:\", planet.moons)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Tables can mix array and dictionary parts\nmixed = {10, 20, 30, label = \"scores\", unit = \"pts\"}\nprint(\"Array part:\", mixed[1], mixed[2], mixed[3])\nprint(\"Dict part:\", mixed.label, mixed.unit)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Nested tables — build any structure\ntree = {\n  value = \"root\",\n  children = {\n    { value = \"left\",  children = {} },\n    { value = \"right\", children = {\n      { value = \"right-left\", children = {} }\n    }}\n  }\n}\n\nfunction walk(node, depth)\n  depth = depth or 0\n  print(string.rep(\"  \", depth) .. node.value)\n  for _, child in ipairs(node.children) do\n    walk(child, depth + 1)\n  end\nend\n\nwalk(tree)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "## 2. メタテーブル — テーブルに新しい芸当を教える\n\nメタテーブルを使用すると、演算子をオーバーライドしたりカスタムの振る舞いを定義したりできます。これが Lua におけるオブジェクト指向プログラミング（OOP）や演算子オーバーロードなどの実現方法です。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- A 2D vector with operator overloading\nVec2 = {}\nVec2.__index = Vec2\n\nfunction Vec2.new(x, y)\n  return setmetatable({x = x, y = y}, Vec2)\nend\n\nfunction Vec2:__add(other)\n  return Vec2.new(self.x + other.x, self.y + other.y)\nend\n\nfunction Vec2:__mul(scalar)\n  return Vec2.new(self.x * scalar, self.y * scalar)\nend\n\nfunction Vec2:length()\n  return math.sqrt(self.x^2 + self.y^2)\nend\n\nfunction Vec2:__tostring()\n  return string.format(\"(%g, %g)\", self.x, self.y)\nend\n\na = Vec2.new(3, 4)\nb = Vec2.new(1, 2)\nprint(\"a =\", a)\nprint(\"b =\", b)\nprint(\"a + b =\", a + b)\nprint(\"a * 3 =\", a * 3)\nprint(\"|a| =\", a:length())",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "## 3. クロージャ\n\nLua の関数は第一級の値であり、自身を囲むスコープから変数をキャプチャします。これにより、クロージャが自然かつ強力に機能します。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- A counter factory — each call returns a new, independent counter\nfunction make_counter(start)\n  local n = start or 0\n  return {\n    inc = function() n = n + 1; return n end,\n    dec = function() n = n - 1; return n end,\n    get = function() return n end\n  }\nend\n\nc1 = make_counter(0)\nc2 = make_counter(100)\n\nc1.inc(); c1.inc(); c1.inc()\nc2.dec()\n\nprint(\"c1:\", c1.get())  -- 3\nprint(\"c2:\", c2.get())  -- 99",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Memoization via closures\nfunction memoize(fn)\n  local cache = {}\n  return function(n)\n    if cache[n] == nil then\n      cache[n] = fn(n)\n    end\n    return cache[n]\n  end\nend\n\nfib = memoize(function(n)\n  if n < 2 then return n end\n  return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)\nend)\n\nfor i = 0, 15 do\n  io.write(fib(i) .. \" \")\nend\nprint()",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Partial application\nfunction partial(fn, ...)\n  local outer_args = table.pack(...)\n  return function(...)\n    local args = {}\n    for i = 1, outer_args.n do args[i] = outer_args[i] end\n    local inner = table.pack(...)\n    for i = 1, inner.n do args[outer_args.n + i] = inner[i] end\n    return fn(table.unpack(args, 1, outer_args.n + inner.n))\n  end\nend\n\nfunction add(a, b) return a + b end\n\nadd10 = partial(add, 10)\nprint(\"add10(5) =\", add10(5))\nprint(\"add10(32) =\", add10(32))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "## 4. コルーチン\n\nコルーチンは、Lua における協調的マルチタスクの仕組みです。スレッドとは異なり、明示的に制御を譲渡（yield）します — ロックも競合も想定外の挙動もありません。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Basic coroutine: a producer that yields values\nfunction producer()\n  local items = {\"alpha\", \"beta\", \"gamma\", \"delta\"}\n  for _, item in ipairs(items) do\n    print(\"  producing: \" .. item)\n    coroutine.yield(item)\n  end\nend\n\nco = coroutine.create(producer)\n\nprint(\"Consumer loop:\")\nwhile coroutine.status(co) ~= \"dead\" do\n  local ok, value = coroutine.resume(co)\n  if ok and value then\n    print(\"  consumed:  \" .. value)\n  end\nend",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Infinite sequence generator\nfunction fibonacci()\n  local a, b = 0, 1\n  while true do\n    coroutine.yield(a)\n    a, b = b, a + b\n  end\nend\n\nfib_co = coroutine.wrap(fibonacci)\n\nio.write(\"Fibonacci: \")\nfor i = 1, 12 do\n  io.write(fib_co() .. \" \")\nend\nprint()",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Pipeline: chaining coroutines as filters\nfunction range(n)\n  return coroutine.wrap(function()\n    for i = 1, n do coroutine.yield(i) end\n  end)\nend\n\nfunction filter(source, pred)\n  return coroutine.wrap(function()\n    for val in source do\n      if pred(val) then coroutine.yield(val) end\n    end\n  end)\nend\n\nfunction map(source, fn)\n  return coroutine.wrap(function()\n    for val in source do\n      coroutine.yield(fn(val))\n    end\n  end)\nend\n\n-- Pipeline: 1..20 → keep odds → square them\npipeline = map(\n  filter(range(20), function(x) return x % 2 == 1 end),\n  function(x) return x * x end\n)\n\nio.write(\"Odd squares: \")\nfor val in pipeline do\n  io.write(val .. \" \")\nend\nprint()",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Cooperative scheduler — round-robin task runner\nfunction scheduler()\n  local tasks = {}\n\n  local sched = {}\n\n  function sched.spawn(fn)\n    tasks[#tasks + 1] = coroutine.create(fn)\n  end\n\n  function sched.run()\n    while #tasks > 0 do\n      local next_tasks = {}\n      for _, co in ipairs(tasks) do\n        local ok, err = coroutine.resume(co)\n        if not ok then print(\"Error: \" .. err) end\n        if coroutine.status(co) ~= \"dead\" then\n          next_tasks[#next_tasks + 1] = co\n        end\n      end\n      tasks = next_tasks\n    end\n  end\n\n  return sched\nend\n\nS = scheduler()\n\nS.spawn(function()\n  for i = 1, 4 do\n    print(\"  [A] step \" .. i)\n    coroutine.yield()\n  end\nend)\n\nS.spawn(function()\n  for i = 1, 3 do\n    print(\"  [B] step \" .. i)\n    coroutine.yield()\n  end\nend)\n\nS.spawn(function()\n  for i = 1, 2 do\n    print(\"  [C] step \" .. i)\n    coroutine.yield()\n  end\nend)\n\nprint(\"Running scheduler:\")\nS.run()\nprint(\"All tasks complete.\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "## 5. カスタムイテレータ\n\nLua の `for ... in` ループは、値を返す任意の関数と連動します。クロージャやコルーチンと組み合わせることで、表現力豊かなイテレータを構築できます。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Closure-based iterator: iterate a table in sorted key order\nfunction sorted_pairs(t)\n  local keys = {}\n  for k in pairs(t) do keys[#keys + 1] = k end\n  table.sort(keys)\n  local i = 0\n  return function()\n    i = i + 1\n    local k = keys[i]\n    if k then return k, t[k] end\n  end\nend\n\nscores = { alice = 92, bob = 87, carol = 95, dave = 78 }\n\nprint(\"Sorted leaderboard:\")\nfor name, score in sorted_pairs(scores) do\n  print(string.format(\"  %-8s %d\", name, score))\nend",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Coroutine iterator: permutations of a list\nfunction permutations(t)\n  local function generate(a, k)\n    if k == 1 then\n      coroutine.yield(a)\n    else\n      for i = 1, k do\n        generate(a, k - 1)\n        if k % 2 == 0 then\n          a[i], a[k] = a[k], a[i]\n        else\n          a[1], a[k] = a[k], a[1]\n        end\n      end\n    end\n  end\n\n  return coroutine.wrap(function()\n    -- Work on a copy\n    local copy = {}\n    for i, v in ipairs(t) do copy[i] = v end\n    generate(copy, #copy)\n  end)\nend\n\nprint(\"Permutations of {1,2,3}:\")\nfor perm in permutations({1, 2, 3}) do\n  print(\"  \" .. table.concat(perm, \", \"))\nend",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "## 6. すべてを統合する — 遅延ストリームライブラリ\n\nテーブル、クロージャ、コルーチン、メタテーブルを組み合わせて、メソッドチェーンが可能な遅延ストリームを作成します。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "Stream = {}\nStream.__index = Stream\n\nfunction Stream.from(t)\n  return setmetatable({ _gen = function()\n    for _, v in ipairs(t) do coroutine.yield(v) end\n  end }, Stream)\nend\n\nfunction Stream.range(a, b)\n  return setmetatable({ _gen = function()\n    for i = a, b do coroutine.yield(i) end\n  end }, Stream)\nend\n\nfunction Stream:filter(pred)\n  local parent = self._gen\n  return setmetatable({ _gen = function()\n    for val in coroutine.wrap(parent) do\n      if pred(val) then coroutine.yield(val) end\n    end\n  end }, Stream)\nend\n\nfunction Stream:map(fn)\n  local parent = self._gen\n  return setmetatable({ _gen = function()\n    for val in coroutine.wrap(parent) do\n      coroutine.yield(fn(val))\n    end\n  end }, Stream)\nend\n\nfunction Stream:take(n)\n  local parent = self._gen\n  return setmetatable({ _gen = function()\n    local count = 0\n    for val in coroutine.wrap(parent) do\n      count = count + 1\n      coroutine.yield(val)\n      if count >= n then return end\n    end\n  end }, Stream)\nend\n\nfunction Stream:reduce(fn, init)\n  local acc = init\n  for val in coroutine.wrap(self._gen) do\n    acc = fn(acc, val)\n  end\n  return acc\nend\n\nfunction Stream:collect()\n  local result = {}\n  for val in coroutine.wrap(self._gen) do\n    result[#result + 1] = val\n  end\n  return result\nend\n\nfunction Stream:__tostring()\n  return \"{\" .. table.concat(self:collect(), \", \") .. \"}\"\nend",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "-- Use the stream library\nresult = Stream.range(1, 50)\n  :filter(function(x) return x % 3 == 0 end)  -- divisible by 3\n  :map(function(x) return x * x end)          -- square\n  :take(5)                                     -- first 5\n\nprint(\"Stream result:\", result)\n\nsum = Stream.from({4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42})\n  :filter(function(x) return x > 10 end)\n  :reduce(function(a, b) return a + b end, 0)\n\nprint(\"Sum of values > 10:\", sum)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "lua"
      },
      {
        "code": "## まとめ\n\nLua は小さな言語の中に多くのパワーを凝縮しています:\n\n| 機能 | 代替するもの |\n|---|---|\n| テーブル | 配列、辞書、オブジェクト、モジュール、名前空間 |\n| メタテーブル | 演算子オーバーロード、継承、プロキシ |\n| クロージャ | カプセル化、ファクトリ、コールバック |\n| コルーチン | ジェネレータ、async/await、グリーンスレッド |\n| イテレータ | 遅延シーケンス、パイプライン |\n\nセクション 6 の Stream ライブラリは、これら**5つすべて**を使用しています — 格納用のテーブル、メソッドチェーン用のメタテーブル、ジェネレータ状態をキャプチャするクロージャ、遅延評価用のコルーチン、そして消費用のイテレータです。\n\nLua はゲームエンジン（Love2D、Roblox、WoW）、組み込みシステム、および設定言語（Neovim、nginx、Redis）として広く使用されています。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "lua"
      }
    ]
  }
}
